    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 3ed5a853230bd76b966306cb77c9aff0c65e99aa -->\n**Review (M3, safety tier): ready for the maintainer to merge.** There are no blockers.\n\n**What looks good:**\n- **The flag:** a stock copy carries its source's reduced-fidelity flag through SetStock, UpdateModel propagation, the CreateSetup clone, DeleteSetup undo and the project file. Each undo restores the previous flag.\n- **The refusal wins:** `program_tol` lets the gate's named refusal win over the sim, so a refusal no longer prints beside a gouge line. It never judges looser than before.\n- **The tolerance:** `FieldView.tol` replaces `DEV_TOL` in `mesh_classes` and in both eyes.\n- **The project format is unchanged** (it reuses the existing `coarse_mm` key), and an older file adopts its source's flag on load.\n- **No forbidden changes:** no unwrap or panic outside tests, no new dependencies, and no process files, goldens or snapshot PNGs. Every file is under 400 lines.\n\n**Local results** (merged with main 29fb6848, clean):\n- **app:** `fidelity_copies` 5, `model_fidelity` 9, `coarse_laws` 6, `stock_view` 4, `stock_play` 7, `stock_source_verdict` 22, `stock_sim_document` 9, `setups` 12, `project_roundtrip` 73, `commands_undo` 30, lib 154.\n- **ui:** lib (single-threaded) 634, `operations` 31, `shell` 20, `trace_composite` 4, `trace_parity` 5.\n- **Clippy** is clean.\n- **Mutation checks,** each reverted afterwards. Each of these makes the pins fail:\n  - sim back to `verdict_tol`;\n  - SetStock not writing the flag;\n  - `adopt_copies` removed;\n  - the view tolerance back to `DEV_TOL`;\n  - UpdateModel not propagating the flag.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The eyes' `fv.tol` is covered only at `DEV_TOL`, and no pixel run was done.\n- Projects from before #911 stay open on #1056.\n",
